              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 13:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli yīmye amaze imyaka mirongwitatu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Giheburayo igitigiri c’iyo myaka ntikiriho, atari mu Kigiriki.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " amara imyaka ibiri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ari ku ngoma aganza Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli yitoraniriza abantu mu Bisirayeli ibihumbi bitatu; muri bo, ibihumbi bibiri bāba kuri we i Mikimashi no ku musozi w’i Beteli; abandi igihumbi bāba kuri Yonatani i Gibeya h’i Bubenyamini; abasigaye arabacūra, umuntu wese yītāhira i we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.3.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 3:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Yonatani atera abo mu nsago z’ Abafilisitiya i Geba, arabatsinda; abandi Bafilisitiya baravyumva. Maze Sauli avugisha inzamba mu gihugu cose, kugira ngw Abaheburayo bavyumve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bose bumva bavuga ko Sauli yatsinze Abafilisitiya bo mur’ izo nsago, kandi kw ari bo nyene bāsomboroje Abafilisitiya. Nukw abantu bakōndōrera kuri Sauli i Gilugali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 11:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abafilisitiya barakorakorana ngo barwanye Abisirayeli; bāri bafise imikogote y’intambara ibihumbi mirongwitatu, n’abagendera ku mafarasi ibihumbi bitandatu, n’ingabo nyinshi nk’umusenyi wo kw isēsero ry’ikiyaga; baradūga, basagaza i Mikimashi ku ruhande rw’i Beti‐aveni ruhera i burasirazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Abisirayeli babonye ko babuze epfo na ruguru, kuko bāri mu karindiro, baja kwinyegeza mu masenga no mu bisaka no mu bitandara no mu bihuma no mu vyobo vyimbiwe kubīka amazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbere bamwe bo mu Baheburayo bāri bajabutse Yorodani, baja mu gihugu c’i Gadi n’i Gileyadi; ariko Sauli we yar’ akir’ i Gilugali; kand’ abāri bakiri kuri we bāri bakūtse imitima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Sauli amaray’ imisi ndwi, arorereye Samweli, nk’uko yari yamuhaye indagano; arikw abantu bāri bāgiye biyonjorora bamuta, Samweli ataraza i Gilugali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ni kwo kuvuga, ati Ni munzanire hano ikimazi co kwosa n’ibimazi vy’ishimwe. Nuko yosa ico kimazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agiheza kucosa, Samweli arashika; maze Sauli arasohoka aja kumusanganira ngw amuramutse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Samweli aramubaza, at’ Ivyo wakoze n’ ibiki? Sauli aramwishura, at’ Erega nabonye abantu biyonjoroye bāntaye, kandi nawe nyene utaje muri ya ndagano, Abafilisitiya na bo bariko barakorakorana i Mikimashi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuko nca niyumvira, nt’ Abafilisitiya bahava bamanuka ubu nyene i Gilugali bantere, kandi nanje ntaringinga Uhoraho ngw ampangaze; ni kwo gupfa guhāngāra, nosa ikimazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.24.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 24:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.16.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 16:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Samweli abgira Sauli, ati Wakoze ic’ ubupfu; iyo wumvira icagezwe Uhoraho Imana yawe yakugeze, Uhoraho na we yokomeje ubgami bgawe ibihe vyose mu Bisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 13:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko noneh’ ubgami bgawe ntibuzohangama; Uhoraho aramaze kwironderera umuntu ameze nk’uk’ umutima wiwe ugomba; kandi ni we Uhoraho yashinze ngw az’ abe segaba w’abantu biwe, kuk’ utumviye ic’ Uhoraho yakugeze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Samweli ava hasi, ava i Gilugali, aja i Gibeya h’i Bubenyamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Sauli aharūra abantu bari kumwe na we, baba nk’amajana atandatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Sauli na Yonatani umuhungu wiwe n’abari kumwe na bo baguma i Geba h’i Bubenyamini; arikw Abafilisitiya bāri bashagaje i Mikimashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye abanyazi b’Abafilisitiya bava aho bashagaje, bīcīyemw’ imice itatu: umuce umwe ujana inzira ija i Ofura, mu gihugu c’i Shuwali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uwundi ujana inzira ija i Beti‐horoni; uwundi ujana inzira igendana urubibe rurāba ku mwonga w’i Seboyimu ahahera mu bugaragwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
