              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe nta mucuzi yar’ akiboneka mu gihugu cose c’Abisirayeli; kukw Abafilisitiya bari bavuze, bati Hinge tubuze Abaheburayo kwicurishiriza inkota n’ amacumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abisirayeli bose bāhora bamanuka mu Bafilisitiya, umuntu wese ngw anagūzeyo isuka yiwe cank’ imbāzo cank’ incabiti cank’ umuhoro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kand’ impembo bācira isuka cank’ imbāzo ryar’ ihera ryitwa pimu, iyo bācira kunagūra incabiti canke gukwikira ikimīto, car’ ikigira gatatu ca shekeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
